{#
Streak macros (Coding Assignment #1) — the presentation layer of the
contributions domain.

Every macro here receives PLAIN VALUES (ints / dicts / bools) prepared by the
routes in app.py — never domain entities — so templates stay decoupled from
domains/. All of them are quiet for users with no streak (streak 0 renders
nothing), per the acceptance checklist.

Design claims behind the visible design:
  - badge everywhere  -> ch2 DC 12 (social proof) / ch3 DC 15 (bonds)
  - banner, only for  -> ch2 DC 4 (personalized ask, not a broadcast) and
    users who care       DC 6 (benefit-stressing, not nagging the inactive)
  - stats framed as   -> ch2 DC 21 ("done enough"): the best is a target to
    a target to beat     beat, and the record line only appears when it is true
#}

{% from "macros/user_macros.html.j2" import user_display %}

{% macro streak_badge(streaks, user_id) %}
  {# The 🔥N pill shown next to a username. Looks the user up in the
     page-level `streaks` dict ({user_id: current_streak}) the route computed
     in ONE batch query. Renders nothing for streak 0 / absent users. #}
  {% set streak = streaks.get(user_id, 0) if streaks is defined and streaks else 0 %}
  {% if streak > 0 %}
    <span class="streak-badge"
          title="Active contribution streak: {{ streak }} day{{ 's' if streak != 1 }}">🔥 {{ streak }}</span>
  {% endif %}
{% endmacro %}

{% macro user_with_streak(streaks, user_id, username) %}
  {# Convenience for sites that are NOT already wrapped in a link: the
     existing user_display macro (which renders its own <a>) plus the badge. #}
  {{ user_display(username) }}{{ streak_badge(streaks, user_id) }}
{% endmacro %}

{% macro streak_banner(at_risk, streak) %}
  {# Feed banner for the logged-in viewer. Shows ONLY when the viewer has a
     live streak but has not contributed today (at risk) — never nags users
     with no streak going (DC 4/6). #}
  {% if at_risk and streak > 0 %}
    <div class="streak-banner" role="alert">
      🔥 Your <strong>{{ streak }}-day streak</strong> is at risk — contribute
      today (a post or a comment) to keep it alive!
    </div>
  {% endif %}
{% endmacro %}

{% macro streak_stats(streak, best) %}
  {# Profile block: current streak next to the personal best, framed as a
     target to beat (DC 21). Hidden entirely for users with no activity. #}
  {% if streak > 0 %}
    <div class="streak-stats">
      <span class="streak-stats-item">🔥 Current: <strong>{{ streak }}</strong></span>
      <span class="streak-stats-sep">·</span>
      <span class="streak-stats-item">Best: <strong>{{ best }}</strong></span>
      {% if streak >= best %}
        <span class="streak-record">You're at your best — keep going!</span>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  {% endif %}
{% endmacro %}